      "text": "[Interpretation] Fine. Today is the 15th of November 2007. Let me greet everyone in this courtroom, the Prosecution, the Defence as well as the accused and everyone in and around the courtroom. We are going to complete this week of hearing with the testimony of this witness. Let's first move into closed session."
